          "key": "daily_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Concrete daily-report boundary",
          "guidance": "This record does not approve formwork, shoring, excavation, mix design, placement loads, stripping, or structural acceptance and does not replace engineered plans, inspections, or competent-person duties. The daily report records observed facts and does not itself release work or close required actions."
        }
